WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
An editable city built from repeatable rules.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Residential blocks and street details.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Industrial blocks use a different building vocabulary.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Editor controls: choose a preset and protect a block.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
The left block is locked. The right block can be rerolled.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Only Block_01_02 changes; Block_01_01 keeps its geometry.

00:30.000 --> 00:37.000
Street-level composition in the existing playable scene.

00:37.000 --> 00:42.000
A plaza brings the generated layout together.
